<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0b173f;letter-spacing:.6pt;"><span style="color:#0b173f;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.6pt;">二、 容易含有 PAHs 的四大高風險食品類別</span></p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;根據食藥署及產業監控統計，以下四類食品因加工特性而屬於 PAHs 殘留高風險群：</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;🔥 燒烤肉類與水產：</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;品項： 高脂肪肉類、燒味與肉乾、煙燻鮭魚、柴魚（鰹魚乾）等。</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;原因： 直火燒烤時油脂滴入火源產生濃煙回燻，或長時間煙燻製程累積高濃度 PAHs。</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;🛢️ 食用油脂類：</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;品項： 原料烘焙與乾燥、高溫精煉製程植物油（如山茶油、沙棘籽油、黑種草油）。</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;原因： 油籽在高溫熱風乾燥或油脂精煉（高溫脫臭/脫色）階段，親脂性 PAHs 易溶解並富集。</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;🌿 乾燥蔬果與草本：</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;品項： 調味料或香辛料、乾燥香草植物、部分茶葉。</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;原因： 傳統燃煤或熱風乾燥過程中，易吸收空氣煙塵中的多環芳香化合物。</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;💊 特殊營養補充品：</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;品項： 蜂膠、蜂王乳與螺旋藻等。</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.4pt;"><span style="font-family:Segoe UI Symbol,Arial Unicode MS,Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;">&#9670;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;原因： 蜂膠原料採集或藍綠藻類培養環境受環境空氣/水體 PAHs 污染蓄積。</p>
<p style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0b173f;letter-spacing:.6pt;"><span style="color:#0b173f;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;letter-spacing:.6pt;">🛡️ 希派標準品 (CPAchem) PAH4 / PAHs 檢測對照品解決方案</span></p>
